-- Breath of the Wild data the map was missing, from the game's own files
-- (dev/assets/botw/missing-data.py; docs/BotW-Missing-Data.md): its dragons
-- and their flight paths, its 37 shops, all 152 quests by the game's names
-- (main, side, shrine and DLC) where they start, its DLC treasure chests, and
-- Master Mode's chests, floating platforms and extra enemies, in categories of
-- their own (DLC ones styled like Shrine of Trials (DLC); Master Mode a menu
-- section of its own). The site's quest and DLC chest markers
-- keep their ids, completions and text: they take the game's name, category
-- and position, each kept in their history, and only while unchanged since.
-- New markers are 196xxxxx, credited to account 15. Harmless to run again.


